# Week 2 — Deep Learning for NLP

## Overview
This week focuses on applying machine learning and deep learning techniques to NLP problems.  
We explore word embeddings, sequence models, and sentiment classification.

---

## Concepts Covered
- Word Embeddings:
  - Word2Vec
  - GloVe
- Neural Networks for NLP:
  - RNN
  - GRU
  - LSTM
- Attention mechanism (introductory)
- Bag-of-Words and TF-IDF
- Evaluation metrics:
  - Accuracy
  - F1-score

---

## Coding Tasks Implemented
- Training Word2Vec embeddings on a small corpus
- Building a TF-IDF + Logistic Regression sentiment classifier
- Implementing an LSTM-based sentiment classifier
- Visualizing word embeddings using PCA / t-SNE
- Exploring Hugging Face datasets

---

## Mini-Project
**Performance Comparison:**
- TF-IDF + Logistic Regression
- LSTM-based Sentiment Classifier

